## Dataset & Database Schema

The dataset contains customer, order, product, and transaction data for an e-commerce business.

The database consists of four tables:
### Customers

| Column |
|----------|
| customer_id |
| customer_name |
| email |
| city |
| country |
| signup_date |

### Orders

| Column |
|----------|
| order_id |
| customer_id |
| order_date |

### Products

| Column |
|----------|
| product_id |
| product_name |
| category |
| price |

### Order Items

| Column |
|----------|
| order_item_id |
| order_id |
| product_id |
| quantity |

