## Analysis Performed

### Data Cleaning
- Null value checks
- Duplicate checks
- Referential integrity validation
- Invalid value detection

### Exploratory Data Analysis
- Total revenue
- Total orders
- Total customers
- Product distribution
- Revenue distribution

### Sales Analysis
- Monthly revenue trends
- Revenue by category
- Average order value
- Order performance analysis

### Customer Analysis
- Top customers
- Customer lifetime value (CLV)
- Revenue by city
- Customer segmentation

### Product Analysis
- Product revenue analysis
- Category performance
- Best-selling products
- Product rankings

### Time Series Analysis
- Monthly sales trends
- Running revenue totals
- Month-over-month growth
- Moving averages

### Advanced SQL Analysis
- Common Table Expressions (CTEs)
- Window Functions
- RANK(), DENSE_RANK(), ROW_NUMBER()
- Pareto (80/20) Analysis

### RFM Analysis
- Recency
- Frequency
- Monetary Value
- Customer Segmentation


## Key Insights

## Key Insights

- Identified top-performing products and categories by revenue.
- Determined the highest-value customers based on customer lifetime value.
- Measured monthly revenue trends and growth patterns.
- Segmented customers using RFM analysis.
- A small percentage of customers generated a large share of total revenue (Pareto principle).
- Repeat customers contributed significantly more revenue than one-time customers.


